# The stack holds 128 values more than maxp asks for (here 0): glyph i pushes
# 119 + i values and then rounds point 1 in y, which a glyph short of room
# for its last push does not reach.
heights 16384
maxp stack 0
fpgm
  PUSH 0; FDEF; ENDF
end
